    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cwædon: se ðe tyman scolde, þæt he hæfde ungeligene gewitnesse ðæs ðæt he hit on riht tymde, oððe þone að funde, ðe se gelyfan mihte ðe onsprece.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, we have declared that he who has to vouch [another man] to warranty, shall have trustworthy witnesses that he is doing so in accordance with the law; or he shall produce an oath which he who brings the accusation may place confidence in.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cwædon: se ðe tyman scolde, þæt he hæfde ungeligene gewitnesse ðæs þæt he hit on riht tymde, oððe ðone að funde, ðe se gelyfan mæge ðe onspræce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
